<title>USA: IPC Information says CFO Riedel resigns.</title>
<headline>IPC Information says CFO Riedel resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPC Information Systems Inc said on Friday that Gregory Riedel has left the company as chief financial officer to pursue other career interests.</p>
<p>Riedel resigned to join another firm, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>IPC said it expects to name a replacement in the next few months, but Terry Clontz, the chief executive officer and president, will handle Riedel's investor relations duties.</p>
<p>The company's senior staff will handle Riedel's finance responsibilities in the interim, IPC said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610</p>
